'''Cats in the Snow''' (にゃんこ雪まつり, ''Nyanko Yuki Matsuri'', '''Cat Snow Festival''') is the Winter event in [[The Battle Cats]]. It was added in [[Version 5.7 Update|Version 5.7]].

==Event Information==
Brave the big chill and get ready for the limited event Cats in the Snow!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''Take on this challenge between December 23rd(11am) and January 6th (11am)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF9900|'''●All-New Special Map: CATS IN THE SNOW'''}}<br>
SNOWBALL FIGHT!!!! Will your Cats be able to withstand the wintry assault?<br>
Check out the Stories of Legend/Event Stages map {{Color|#FF0000|'''Cats in the Snow'''}} during this event!<br>
Can you topple [[Le'mammoth|{{Color|#34AB53|'''Mammothe'''}}]] and the [[Ice Doge|{{Color|#34AB53|'''Icy Doges'''}}]]?! Win the day, and you can pick up Lucky Tickets that you can use at the special Capsule machine!<br>
Clear later stages to get even better chances to pick up Tickets!

※Update to the most recent version of the Battle Cats to access these events!

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''● Lucky Capsules!'''}}<br>
Get limited Cats, battle items, and XP rewards from this special capsule set!<br>
Visit the Cat Base, then tap the Cat Capsules button and select the {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Lucky Capsules'''}} tab from the top of the screen.<br>
Collect {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Lucky Tickets'''}} as drop rewards from the Summer Lesson map!

※ The Lucky Capsules option will appear after you own at least one Lucky Ticket.<br>
※ Lucky Tickets owned will be held over for the next event even after the current Lucky Capsules event ends.<br>
※ If the Lucky Capsules do not appear, please update your Battle Cats app to the most recent version.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''● Special Missions in the Catnip Challenges!'''}}<br>
Take the Special Mission challenges and earn delightful bonus rewards by playing Cats in the Snow!

※The Special Missions will only appear in the Catnip Challenges until January 9, 2023 at 11am.You must accept all rewards before the mission disappears at the end of the Catnip Challenges event!

